quran[6]{c,v,t}:
  5,71,"They supposed there would be no trial, so they became blind and deaf. Then Allah accepted their repentance, but again, many of them became blind and deaf. And Allah is All-Seeing of what they are doing."
  5,72,"They are certainly disbelievers who say: ‘Allah is the Messiah, son of Maryam (Mary).’ Whereas the Messiah himself said: ‘O Children of Israel! Worship Allah, my Lord and your Lord.’ Whoever ascribes partners to Allah, indeed Allah has forbidden him entrance to Paradise and his refuge shall be the Fire. And the wrongdoers shall have no helpers."
  5,73,"Certainly, they (also) are disbelievers who say: ‘Allah is the third of three,’ while there is no god except the One God. If they do not refrain from what they say, a painful punishment will surely befall the disbelievers among them."
  5,74,"Will they not turn to Allah in repentance and plead with Him for forgiveness? And Allah is Most-Forgiving, All-Merciful."
  5,75,"The Messiah, son of Maryam (Mary), was only a messenger. Indeed, many messengers have passed before him, and his mother was a truthful woman. They both would eat food. Look how we make the signs clear to them, yet see how they go astray!"
  5,76,"Say: ‘Do you worship (something) besides Allah that has no power to bring you any harm or benefit, while Allah alone is the All-Hearing, the All-Knowing?’"
